  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14052682",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-78295",
      "knowledge_point_id": "166cd7e4-5568-5769-8bc6-4ffc4ed8b508",
      "knowledge_point": "Finding the Standard Matrix of a Dilation Given a Vector and its Image",
      "problem": "A linear transformation $T$ represents a dilation.  Given that $v=[\\begin{aligned}-54 \\\\ 81\\end{aligned}]$ and $T(v)=[\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}],$ what is the standard matrix of $T?$",
      "worked_solution": "We can write $T(v)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(v) & =[\\begin{aligned}-6 \\\\ 9\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{9}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-54 \\\\ 81\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{9}v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have $T(v)=\\frac{1}{9}v,$ and so the linear transformation $T$ is a dilation with scale factor $k=\\frac{1}{9}.$\n\nThe matrix that represents a dilation of scale factor $k$ is given by\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}k & 0 \\\\ 0 & k\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the standard matrix of $T$ is\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{9} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{9}\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices_complete": true,
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{9} & 1 \\\\ 1 & \\frac{1}{9}\\end{aligned}]",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "[\\begin{aligned}0 & \\frac{1}{9} \\\\ \\frac{1}{9} & 0\\end{aligned}]",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{9} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{9}\\end{aligned}]",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{9} & 0 \\\\ 1 & 9\\end{aligned}]",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "[\\begin{aligned}9 & 1 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{9}\\end{aligned}]",
              "option": "4",
              "source_option": "e"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "provenance": {
        "activity_question": "question-78295",
        "kp_title": "Finding the Standard Matrix of a Dilation Given a Vector and its Image",
        "kp_href": null
      },
      "topic_id": 867,
